| Access matrix (CRM-RBAC-01) | `app/api/admin/roles`, `admin/roles/[code]`, `admin/roles/[code]/permissions`, `api/internal/v1/workforce/roles`, `admin/users`, `auth/session/refresh-permissions`, `auth/logout`; page `/admin/access` | `Role` (`isSystem`, `cloneFromCode`, `permissionCatalogVersion`), `SatelliteAuditLog`; catalog `src/lib/auth/permissions.ts`; page map `page-route-permissions.ts`; API map `api-route-permissions.ts` |

**RBAC Variant A (CRM-RBAC-01):** `getSatelliteSession()` also builds `permissions` from the role row and checks the stamped API path against `api-route-permissions.ts` (unlisted → 403). `/api/leads` and `/api/leads/[id]` assert `api:leads.read` / `api:leads.write` per method. Pages: middleware `authorizePage` + `page-route-permissions.ts`. A new staff route or page needs a catalog row in the same change. ADR `docs/adr/crm/crm-domain-permissions-and-rbac.md`. CRM ADR index: `docs/adr/crm/README.md`.

**Tenancy (CP-TENANT-01):** `organizationId` on tenant/ops models + kit Prisma extension + `requireSatelliteModule("industry_crm")` (AC-CRM-TENANT 🟡 — not live SHARED pool).

## Platform billing status

`GET /api/platform/billing-status` — `app/api/platform/billing-status/route.ts` re-exports `@era/satellite-kit/billing/status-route` (banner in `EraAppRouteShell`). Staff calls the orchestrator denies (SOFT_BLOCK export, HARD_BLOCK write) get 402 from kit `readSatelliteStaffSession`; `handleRouteError` returns `{ error, code, billingStatus }`. ADR `docs/adr/billing-enforcement-satellites.md`.
